---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | KRIYANO"
  description="Read the KRIYANO Privacy Policy and learn how website data, analytics, cookies and third-party services may be handled."
>
  <section class="pt-[100px] pb-[70px] border-b border-line bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_20%,rgba(183,255,74,0.08),transparent_30%),var(--bg)]">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="mt-[16px] max-w-[850px] text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,5.8rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.055em]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="max-w-[760px] mt-[26px] text-muted text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.75]">This Privacy Policy explains how KRIYANO may collect, use and protect information when you visit or use this website.</p>
      <p class="mt-[20px] text-lime text-[0.75rem] font-black tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-[85px] md:py-[110px]">
    <div class="container grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,820px)] gap-0">
      <article class="grid gap-[48px] md:gap-[34px]">
        {[
          {title:'1. Information we collect',body:'KRIYANO does not currently require visitors to create an account or provide personal information in order to browse most of the website. Basic technical and usage information may be collected automatically when you visit the site. This can include information such as browser type, device type, operating system, approximate location, pages visited, referring pages, performance data and general website usage information.'},
          {title:'2. Website analytics',body:'KRIYANO may use analytics and performance services to understand how visitors use the website, identify technical issues and improve site performance and usability. The website currently uses Cloudflare services, including website traffic, performance and analytics features. Cloudflare may process technical information in accordance with its own privacy practices.'},
          {title:'3. Cookies and similar technologies',body:'KRIYANO may use cookies or similar technologies where necessary for website functionality, security, analytics, advertising or other services. If advertising or additional analytics services are introduced in the future, they may use cookies or similar technologies in accordance with their respective privacy policies and applicable requirements.'},
          {title:'4. Advertising',body:'KRIYANO may display advertising in the future, including advertising provided by third-party advertising networks such as Google AdSense. Advertising providers may use cookies or other technologies to deliver, measure or personalise advertisements where permitted. Additional disclosures may be added to this Privacy Policy when such services are implemented.'},
          {title:'5. Third-party links and services',body:'KRIYANO may contain links to third-party websites, AI platforms, software, products or services. KRIYANO is not responsible for the privacy practices, content or policies of external websites. Visitors should review the privacy policies of third-party services before providing personal information to them.'},
          {title:'6. Tool inputs and AI processing',body:'The Spreadsheet List Cleaner, Margin & Markup Calculator, Quotation Builder and AI Prompt Builder process their inputs in your browser. These tools do not upload inputs to KRIYANO or automatically save them to a database or browser storage. Downloaded files and copied results are under your control. Your browser may retain form state through its own features. KRIYANO CHECK\'s local check extracts signals in your browser. Selecting its online AI review sends the entered text to KRIYANO\'s server and Cloudflare Workers AI for processing. The application does not intentionally save your text or review to a database and does not log the submitted text. Hosting and AI service processing is subject to the providers\' practices; this is not a promise of zero provider retention. Do not submit confidential information, credentials or personal records to the online review. You can use the local check without requesting an AI review. When you copy a prompt into another AI service, that service\'s privacy practices apply.'},
          {title:'7. Data security',body:'Reasonable technical measures are used to help protect the website and its infrastructure. However, no internet transmission or online service can be guaranteed to be completely secure.'},
          {title:'8. Children\'s privacy',body:'KRIYANO is intended as a general information, productivity and educational website and is not specifically directed toward young children.'},
          {title:'9. Changes to this policy',body:'This Privacy Policy may be updated when KRIYANO introduces new features, analytics systems, advertising services, forms, downloads, accounts or other functionality. The latest version will be published on this page together with an updated revision date.'},
          {title:'10. Contact',body:'If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact KRIYANO through the contact information provided on the website.'},
        ].map((section,i)=>(
          <section key={i} class={i === 9 ? '' : 'pb-[40px] border-b border-line md:pb-[32px]'}>
            <h2 class="text-text text-[1.375rem] leading-[1.3] mb-[18px]">{section.title}</h2>
            <p class="text-muted text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8]">{section.body}</p>
          </section>
        ))}
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
